@startuml "AI Service Data Flow and Integration"
title AI Service Data Flow and Integration
!theme bluegray
actor User

participant "Frontend\n(React/Vue/etc.)" as FE
participant "Main Backend\n(FastAPI, etc.)" as BE
participant "AI Service\n(Feedback Generator)" as AI

User -> FE : Interacts with quiz/assignment
FE -> BE : Submit attempt / Request feedback
BE -> AI : Send attempt data for feedback
AI -> BE : Return generated feedback
BE -> FE : Send feedback to frontend
FE -> User : Display feedback

note right of AI
  AI Service may use
  NLP/ML models to analyze
  attempt and generate
  personalized feedback.
end note

@enduml